<h1><span lang="EN-GB">MMX Hardware Assembly</span></h1>
<div class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center;" align="center">
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3"></div>
<p><span class="heading11" lang="EN-GB">To gain a better understanding of the individual components and the system's architecture, please look at the <a href="Hardware_Description_X_System.htm">X System Description</a> before going through Hardware Assembly.</span></p>
<h2>Handling the ModelMaker sensor</h2>
<p id="P4" class="Warning"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font id="font1">ModelMaker is a precision optical measuring instrument, please treat it with care.</font></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><span lang="EN-GB">The ModelMaker sensor has been designed to withstand a typical shop-floor environment, nevertheless, there are certain precautions that should be taken when using the sensor:</span></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;">D</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;">o not drop the sensor.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><span lang="EN-GB">Do not touch the optical windows on the front of the sensor.</span></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><span lang="EN-GB">Do not attempt to dismantle the sensor, doing so will invalidate the &#160;warranty.</span></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><span lang="EN-GB">Do not allow the sensor to be covered in any liquid</span></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><span lang="EN-GB">Do not expose the sensor to extremes of temperatures</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Warning" id="P1"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><span lang="EN-GB">Laser light is emitted from the indicated aperture - do not look directly into the beam or view with an optical instrument.</span></span></p>
<h2>ModelMaker hardware set-up</h2>
<ol>
<li class="kadov-p-Csteps">
<p class="steps">If not already completed, the first step is to set up the <a href="Localiser_Compatibility_MMX.htm">localiser</a></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Csteps">
<p class="steps">Power up the localiser before starting the ModelMaker hardware set-up.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p class="Normalbold">&#160;</p>
<p class="stepstitle">Mounting sensor on a FARO localiser</p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="mso-cellspacing:0in; mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in; margin-left:24px; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0">
<col>
<col>
<tr class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="38" class="whs5">
<p>Mount the FARO arm mount on the end of the arm.</p>
<p>Mount the sensor onto the arm mount</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="78" class="whs8">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="78" class="whs8">
<p>Connect the sensor cable at the back of the sensor and the trigger cable into the rear of the arm.</p>
<p>Use the releasable velcro fixings to clamp the cables to the arm</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="MsoNormal">&#160;</p>
<p class="stepstitle">Mounting MMIB-D on a FARO localiser</p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="mso-cellspacing:0in; mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in; margin-left:24px; left:0px; top:929px; width:743px; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0" width="743">
<col>
<col>
<tr class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Mount the</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">MMIB-D</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">on the top of the FARO control box using the velcro strips which are supplied with the ModelMaker system</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="78" class="whs8">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="78" class="whs8">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Connect the</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">trigger</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">cable</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">into the rear of the MMIB-D and into the rear of FARO control box.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="stepstitle">Using a CimCore localiser</p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="mso-cellspacing:0in; mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in; margin-left:24px; left:0px; top:1308px; width:744px; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0" width="744">
<col>
<col>
<tr class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">To be able to use a CimCore localiser with ModelMaker X, you will need a 75mm</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">probe extension</span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="78" class="whs8">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="78" class="whs8">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Please contact your CimCore distributor to purchase this item.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="stepstitle">Mounting sensor on a CimCore localiser</p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="mso-cellspacing:0in; mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in; margin-left:24px; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0">
<col>
<col>
<tr class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Mount the</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">CimCore</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">arm mount</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">on the end of the arm.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Mount the <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">sensor</span> onto the arm mount.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="78" class="whs8">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="78" class="whs8">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Connect the <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">sensor cable</span></span> <span lang="EN-GB">at the side of the sensor.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Use the releasable velcro fixings to clamp the cables to the arm.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="MsoNormal">&#160;</p>
<h2>PC</h2>
<p>&#160;</p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="mso-cellspacing:0in; mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0">
<col>
<col>
<tr class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Power down the PC.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Insert the power connector into the</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">SURFA PCI 2</span> card.</b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Insert the SURFA PCI 2 into an available PCI slot and connect the power lead to a spare disk drive power lead.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Replace the PC cover.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Plug the 1</span><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">5 way</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">D-type cable</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">into the SURFA card</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="whs11">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="96" class="whs12">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="96" class="whs12">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Plug the</span><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">dongle</span> into the parallel port of the PC.</b></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<h2>ModelMaker Interface Box Digital (MMIB-D)</h2>
<p>&#160;</p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="mso-cellspacing:0in; mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0">
<col>
<col>
<tr class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Connect the</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">sensor</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">cable</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">and the <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">antenna</span></span> <span lang="EN-GB">to the front of the MMIB-D</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr class="whs13">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="42" class="whs14">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p>
</td>
<td height="42" class="whs14">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Connect the</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">SURFA</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">PCI 2 cable</span></b><span lang="EN-GB">, the</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">trigger</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">cable</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">and the foot switches to the rear of the MMIB-D.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="Warning" id="P2"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;">The trigger cable should only be plugged into the MMIB-D after the localiser is powered up.<b>&#160;</b></span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<h2>Foot switches</h2>
<p>&#160;</p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="mso-cellspacing:0in; mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in; width:77.918%; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0" width="77.918%">
<col class="whs15">
<col class="whs16">
<tr class="whs4">
<td height="38" width="187px" class="whs17">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1044" src="footswitches.jpg" width="150px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs18" alt=""></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:12.0pt;"><font size="3" style="font-size:12pt;">&#160;</font></span></p>
</td>
<td rowspan="1" height="38" width="460px" class="whs19">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Connect the</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">foot switches</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">to the rear of the MMIB-D</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="MsoNormal">&#160;</p>
<h2>Miniature Remote Switches</h2>
<p>&#160;</p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="mso-cellspacing:0in; mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0">
<col>
<col>
<tr class="whs4">
<td height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1045" src="../images/remote_min.jpg" width="150px" height="115px" border="0" class="img_whs20" alt=""></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:12.0pt;"><font size="3" style="font-size:12pt;">&#160;</font></span></p>
</td>
<td rowspan="1" height="38" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Connect the</span> <b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">radio</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">antenna</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">to the MMIB-D</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">The remote switch is now ready to use</span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
</td>
