<p>&#160;</p>
<h2>Voice control microphone</h2>
<p class="Note" id="p5"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">: This feature is unsuitable for use in a noisy environment.</span></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">A sound card is required to use this feature and Microsoft Speech SDK v5.1 must be installed (provided on the KUBE CD or can be downloaded from www.microsoft.com).</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><span lang="EN-GB">A microphone is supplied with the ModelMaker X system.</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Warning" id="P3"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><span lang="EN-GB">Ensure the battery is installed and the microphone switched on.</span></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Before using this feature please setup the microphone using Control Panel &gt; Speech on your PC. Select Speech Recognition &gt; Configure microphone and follow the configuration 'wizard'. Experiment with the position of the microphone so it is close to your mouth but not directly in front of it.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-font-size:12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;"><img src="../images/speech1.gif" width="78px" height="51px" border="0" class="img_whs21" alt=""> &#160;To use voice operation in KUBE click on the speech icon in</span> System &gt; Preferences &gt; Audio.</p>
<p><img src="../images/speech2.gif" width="80px" height="52px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""> &#160;In the localiser scan menu, click on the microphone button to enable it.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">The keywords and commands available are all those words found in the Scan menu e.g. 'Prescan', 'Scan', 'View' etc. During Scan mode: 'Start' to start scanning and 'Stop' to pause.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">The speech recognition software is developed by Microsoft. Please refer to the Microsoft help files for more information.</p>
</li>
</ul>

